{"url": "（本地文件）006、第六节：掌握及物动词，表达物品转移的场景.mp4", "link": false, "lang": "zh", "local_path": "G:\\【瑞杰老师】全能英语课程\\瑞杰老师 30 天英语实战训练营(1)\\006、第六节：掌握及物动词，表达物品转移的场景.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 10.87, "text": "欢迎来到这次训练营的第六节。", "end": 17.67}, {"start": 17.67, "text": "前面五节我们讲了带词、误的转移、时态跟一些简单的你我他这个那个。", "end": 25.83}, {"start": 25.83, "text": "今天我们将巩固前面所学并稍微引入一些新的概念。", "end": 31.03}, {"start": 31.03, "text": "记住我们每一节课都跟之前的课程是紧密关联的,不仅要回顾还要去升华。", "end": 39.03}, {"start": 39.03, "text": "今天我们将深化对误的转移和时态的运用,你们今天用完后对前几节又会进行一次巩固。", "end": 47.83}, {"start": 47.83, "text": "我们先看情境一,我们现在已经开始讲误与误之间的互动了,截止到第六节。", "end": 56.63}, {"start": 57.56, "text": "这两个男人,这两个男人,在一个帽子上。", "end": 61.16}, {"start": 61.16, "text": "这个男人是,你注意看哦,这个男人对那个男人正在做一个这个动作。", "end": 70.76}, {"start": 70.76, "text": "他手里有一个帽子,帽子。", "end": 75.35}, {"start": 75.35, "text": "这个男人的手上有一个帽子。", "end": 78.15}, {"start": 78.15, "text": "这个男人的手上有一个帽子。", "end": 83.35}, {"start": 83.75, "text": "那这个动作怎么去表达,就是我们今天要开始解决的问题。", "end": 88.15}, {"start": 88.15, "text": "那显然帽子还没给对方有这个打算,当然也有人会说他已经正在给了,不论什么情况。", "end": 96.15}, {"start": 96.15, "text": "He will give his hat to the man。", "end": 100.95}, {"start": 100.95, "text": "这里引入了一个新的词,to。", "end": 103.75}, {"start": 103.75, "text": "英语所有的从A到B,从B到C,那个箭头,我之前有讲过,那个箭头就是to。", "end": 111.75}, {"start": 112.15, "text": "所以你表达一个物权的转移,一个事情的目的的转移,一个方向性的东西,都会有个箭头。", "end": 120.15}, {"start": 120.15, "text": "那个就是to。", "end": 122.15}, {"start": 122.15, "text": "He,男人He will give,他打算给,可能刚启动,这个意愿刚暴露出来。", "end": 132.15}, {"start": 132.15, "text": "He will give his hat,他的帽子,his hat to the man。", "end": 139.42}, {"start": 139.82, "text": "我既可以把hat给你们to you,也可以to the man。", "end": 144.22}, {"start": 144.22, "text": "所以英语这个to解决的就是这个问题,不论我给谁,我都要清楚的表达出来。", "end": 150.25}, {"start": 150.25, "text": "这个to,to whom,to you,to him,to the man。", "end": 156.95}, {"start": 156.95, "text": "So he will give his hat to the man.", "end": 159.35}, {"start": 159.35, "text": "He is giving his hat to the man,正在给,he is,right?", "end": 166.31}, {"start": 166.71, "text": "Giving his hat,注意in,giving,he is giving his hat to the man,这是进行中了。", "end": 175.11}, {"start": 175.11, "text": "刚刚是启动,will give,现在是giving,这都是我们第四节学的时态。", "end": 180.71}, {"start": 180.71, "text": "现在进行时,is giving his hat to the man,he gave it to the man,已经给完了,现在帽子在男人那里了。", "end": 191.91}, {"start": 192.31, "text": "He gave it to the man,他要走了,right?", "end": 195.11}, {"start": 195.11, "text": "这是完成了,这就是什么,过去时。", "end": 197.91}, {"start": 197.91, "text": "He gave it to the man, he gave it to him。", "end": 203.77}, {"start": 203.77, "text": "这里又出现一个新的代词了,him.", "end": 207.53}, {"start": 207.53, "text": "He gave it to him, he gave it to him。", "end": 213.22}, {"start": 213.22, "text": "有人就说teacher Eric,男人的代词不是he,女人的代词是she,我的代词是I吗?", "end": 221.94}, {"start": 221.94, "text": "怎么冒出一个him来了呢?", "end": 224.34}, {"start": 224.34, "text": "其实这里也不难去理解,为什么一个表音语言要去区分he跟him?", "end": 231.27}, {"start": 231.27, "text": "这就是我们常说的主宾格。", "end": 234.73}, {"start": 234.73, "text": "如果主语是我,我会说什么?I,I am Eric。", "end": 240.33}, {"start": 240.33, "text": "如果主语是男人,he,如果主语是女人,she,she is a woman,对吧?", "end": 247.93}, {"start": 247.93, "text": "我们是不是一直都是这么在讲?", "end": 249.93}, {"start": 249.93, "text": "万一主语不是他呢?而是我呢?", "end": 253.53}, {"start": 253.53, "text": "那我一句话能不能既有I又有he呢?", "end": 257.13}, {"start": 257.13, "text": "I love he,对吧?这里主次不分,对象不明。", "end": 263.91}, {"start": 263.91, "text": "如果两个都是男人,那就更不明确了,会出现什么?", "end": 268.31}, {"start": 268.31, "text": "He gave it to he, he gave it to he。", "end": 274.31}, {"start": 274.31, "text": "那不是自己给了自己吗?听的人会有这个疑惑,right?", "end": 279.11}, {"start": 279.11, "text": "She gave it to she,那是不是她给了自己,这样,是吧?", "end": 285.53}, {"start": 285.53, "text": "所以为什么英语会出现主宾格的区分?", "end": 288.73}, {"start": 288.73, "text": "这是有历史原因的,也有必要性的。", "end": 291.53}, {"start": 291.53, "text": "所以当男人是被动的时候,他在语句里是宾格,就是中文说的宾客。", "end": 299.19}, {"start": 299.19, "text": "他不是主人,是宾客,他是对象,right?", "end": 302.79}, {"start": 302.79, "text": "那这时候就会说him, he gave the hat to him。", "end": 307.99}, {"start": 307.99, "text": "英语里,I也是这样的,I love you,我爱你。", "end": 313.26}, {"start": 313.66, "text": "这里I是我是主语,right?你是宾格。", "end": 316.46}, {"start": 316.46, "text": "万一是你爱我呢?那就是you love me。", "end": 321.98}, {"start": 321.98, "text": "所以你看我也会区分,我不能说I love I,I gave it to I,对吧?", "end": 327.58}, {"start": 327.58, "text": "我要说I gave it to me,我给了自己,是这样的。", "end": 333.37}, {"start": 333.37, "text": "所以I, he, she,对应的就是什么?", "end": 337.37}, {"start": 337.37, "text": "Me, him, her,这是一个主宾格的差异。", "end": 342.92}, {"start": 343.72, "text": "有人就说了,teacher,那you没有主宾格之分吗?", "end": 347.85}, {"start": 347.85, "text": "I love you, you love me,you没有分。", "end": 351.45}, {"start": 351.45, "text": "这个原因,以后我会当一个小知识去跟大家讲。", "end": 354.85}, {"start": 354.85, "text": "大家也不用去想语法的事。", "end": 357.05}, {"start": 357.05, "text": "这句话已经呈现了怎么用了,我们学会怎么去说。", "end": 360.85}, {"start": 360.85, "text": "我们现在也明白为什么要区分主宾格,这是一个语言的必要性。", "end": 365.85}, {"start": 365.85, "text": "He gave it to him,双相都是这样。", "end": 372.07}, {"start": 373.07, "text": "It,这个帽子,It is in the man's hands,在他手里。", "end": 379.6}, {"start": 379.6, "text": "In his hands,里头。", "end": 381.6}, {"start": 381.6, "text": "It is in the man's,注意一撇S,上节课说的hands now,现在。", "end": 388.6}, {"start": 388.6, "text": "多出一个语,时间修饰了,now。", "end": 393.77}, {"start": 393.77, "text": "如果是当时或者别的时间,英语一般说then,这个我们以后再说。", "end": 398.77}, {"start": 398.77, "text": "Now,现在。", "end": 400.77}, {"start": 400.77, "text": "经过一系列复杂的交换行为,现在帽子在哪?", "end": 404.77}, {"start": 404.77, "text": "It is in the man's hands, now。", "end": 409.77}, {"start": 409.77, "text": "对吧,他做了一个总结。", "end": 411.77}, {"start": 411.77, "text": "现在在他手里啦,It is in the man's hands, now。", "end": 414.77}, {"start": 414.77, "text": "当然你不说now也行,It is in the man's hands,也能呈现这句话。", "end": 419.77}, {"start": 419.77, "text": "他强调now,是做一个有点像总结啦。", "end": 422.77}, {"start": 422.77, "text": "现在终于在他手里啦。", "end": 424.77}, {"start": 424.77, "text": "现在情境做了一个微小的变化。", "end": 427.77}, {"start": 427.77, "text": "但是概念都没变,只是把对象换成了一个女人。", "end": 433.33}, {"start": 433.33, "text": "那我们试试看。", "end": 434.33}, {"start": 434.33, "text": "我们知道这个时候按照这个图的意识,他是还没给。", "end": 438.33}, {"start": 438.33, "text": "所以这里是一个意愿。", "end": 440.33}, {"start": 440.33, "text": "帽子还在我手里。", "end": 441.33}, {"start": 441.33, "text": "那我要说什么?", "end": 442.33}, {"start": 442.33, "text": "He,他是主语,所以是he will give。", "end": 448.64}, {"start": 448.64, "text": "他打算给。", "end": 450.64}, {"start": 450.64, "text": "Will,意愿。", "end": 451.64}, {"start": 451.64, "text": "Will give the hat to her。", "end": 455.58}, {"start": 455.58, "text": "就不是she啦,对吧。", "end": 462.19}, {"start": 462.19, "text": "如果是他给他。", "end": 463.98}, {"start": 463.98, "text": "She will give the hat to him.", "end": 465.98}, {"start": 465.98, "text": "He will give the hat to her.", "end": 467.98}, {"start": 467.98, "text": "The man will give his hat to the woman。", "end": 471.98}, {"start": 471.98, "text": "这里他还不做代词,他直接写出来了。", "end": 475.57}, {"start": 475.57, "text": "当然你们也可以这样。", "end": 476.57}, {"start": 476.57, "text": "我跟你讲,有时候混乱的时候,别折腾。", "end": 479.57}, {"start": 479.57, "text": "直接全说出来不就好了。", "end": 481.57}, {"start": 481.57, "text": "别用代词嘛。", "end": 482.57}, {"start": 482.57, "text": "你直接说了。", "end": 483.57}, {"start": 483.57, "text": "The man will give his hat to the woman。", "end": 486.57}, {"start": 486.57, "text": "你写出来不完了吗?", "end": 488.57}, {"start": 488.57, "text": "所以英语也很活的,你不用去使劲硬背。", "end": 491.57}, {"start": 491.57, "text": "那当然进一步说就是什么?", "end": 493.57}, {"start": 493.57, "text": "He is giving his hat,正在给。", "end": 497.57}, {"start": 497.57, "text": "两边的手都在交接。", "end": 499.57}, {"start": 499.57, "text": "He is giving his hat to the woman。", "end": 505.61}, {"start": 505.61, "text": "他这里进得很慢。", "end": 508.46}, {"start": 508.46, "text": "好事。", "end": 509.46}, {"start": 509.46, "text": "He is giving the hat to the woman。", "end": 512.46}, {"start": 512.46, "text": "没问题吧。", "end": 513.46}, {"start": 513.46, "text": "Is giving,正在给。", "end": 516.46}, {"start": 516.46, "text": "所以时态再回顾一次。", "end": 518.46}, {"start": 518.46, "text": "He gave it to the woman。", "end": 521.46}, {"start": 521.46, "text": "给完了。", "end": 522.46}, {"start": 522.46, "text": "Who is holding the hat?", "end": 524.46}, {"start": 524.46, "text": "The woman is holding the hat。", "end": 526.46}, {"start": 526.46, "text": "正拿着。", "end": 527.46}, {"start": 527.46, "text": "The woman is holding the hat.", "end": 529.46}, {"start": 529.46, "text": "He gave it to the woman。", "end": 531.46}, {"start": 531.46, "text": "He gave it to her。", "end": 537.46}, {"start": 537.46, "text": "He gave it。", "end": 539.46}, {"start": 539.46, "text": "给完了。", "end": 540.46}, {"start": 540.46, "text": "不是give了。", "end": 542.46}, {"start": 542.46, "text": "是gave,是过去式了。", "end": 544.46}, {"start": 544.46, "text": "Gave it to her,不是she。", "end": 547.46}, {"start": 547.46, "text": "当然你反过来说什么?", "end": 550.11}, {"start": 550.11, "text": "She took it。", "end": 552.11}, {"start": 552.11, "text": "拿过来take。", "end": 554.11}, {"start": 554.11, "text": "记不记得take这个词。", "end": 556.11}, {"start": 556.11, "text": "She,这里就是she啦。", "end": 558.11}, {"start": 558.11, "text": "She took it from。", "end": 560.11}, {"start": 560.11, "text": "主被动换啦。", "end": 562.11}, {"start": 562.11, "text": "所以只看你讲的顺序。", "end": 564.11}, {"start": 564.11, "text": "没有一个行为是固定主被动的。", "end": 566.11}, {"start": 566.11, "text": "全看顺序。", "end": 567.11}, {"start": 567.11, "text": "It is in the woman's hands now。", "end": 572.11}, {"start": 572.11, "text": "刚说的now,现在。", "end": 574.11}, {"start": 574.11, "text": "It is in the woman's hands now。", "end": 580.11}, {"start": 580.11, "text": "所以这里就是相爱换一个性别。", "end": 582.11}, {"start": 582.11, "text": "其他概念都没再变了。", "end": 584.11}, {"start": 584.11, "text": "越是到后面,我们的故事会越来越情节啦。", "end": 588.11}, {"start": 588.11, "text": "所以显然他们不会再把帽子递来递去啦。", "end": 591.11}, {"start": 591.11, "text": "女人拿着帽子走了。", "end": 593.11}, {"start": 593.11, "text": "那她去干嘛啦?", "end": 594.11}, {"start": 594.11, "text": "Let's see。", "end": 595.11}, {"start": 595.11, "text": "What is the woman doing?", "end": 596.11}, {"start": 596.11, "text": "She。", "end": 597.11}, {"start": 597.11, "text": "她好像打算把帽子放到桌上。", "end": 601.98}, {"start": 601.98, "text": "别忘了我们这些小伙才人,她这样的时候是有这个打算。", "end": 605.98}, {"start": 605.98, "text": "还不算是在做。", "end": 607.98}, {"start": 607.98, "text": "那我也不确定。", "end": 608.98}, {"start": 608.98, "text": "但是我知道她有这个打算。", "end": 610.98}, {"start": 610.98, "text": "So she will put, take, give.", "end": 620.16}, {"start": 620.16, "text": "She will put the hat in the table or on the table?", "end": 626.05}, {"start": 626.05, "text": "桌面上。", "end": 628.05}, {"start": 628.05, "text": "On the table.", "end": 629.05}, {"start": 629.05, "text": "The woman will put the hat on the table.", "end": 633.05}, {"start": 633.05, "text": "没问题吧?", "end": 634.48}, {"start": 634.48, "text": "都是我们已经学过的啦。", "end": 636.48}, {"start": 636.48, "text": "She will put the hat on the table.", "end": 640.48}, {"start": 640.48, "text": "她正在放。", "end": 641.48}, {"start": 641.48, "text": "已经快放好了。", "end": 643.48}, {"start": 643.48, "text": "She is putting the hat on the table.", "end": 650.8}, {"start": 650.8, "text": "She is putting it on the table.", "end": 655.13}, {"start": 655.13, "text": "不说the hat,直接用代词it。", "end": 657.13}, {"start": 657.13, "text": "没问题。", "end": 658.13}, {"start": 658.13, "text": "She put it there.", "end": 660.13}, {"start": 660.13, "text": "Here 迪尔杰克的。", "end": 663.1}, {"start": 663.1, "text": "Here there.", "end": 666.1}, {"start": 666.1, "text": "She put it there.", "end": 668.92}, {"start": 668.92, "text": "这个put是过去式啦。", "end": 670.92}, {"start": 670.92, "text": "put的过去式就是put。", "end": 672.92}, {"start": 672.92, "text": "Put will put, putting put.", "end": 675.92}, {"start": 675.92, "text": "She put it there.", "end": 676.92}, {"start": 676.92, "text": "放在那里。", "end": 677.92}, {"start": 677.92, "text": "这个是虚线啊。", "end": 678.92}, {"start": 678.92, "text": "这个帽子已经不存在了。", "end": 680.92}, {"start": 680.92, "text": "是虚线。", "end": 681.92}, {"start": 681.92, "text": "实线在这里啊。", "end": 682.92}, {"start": 682.92, "text": "注意这个细节。", "end": 683.92}, {"start": 683.92, "text": "So这个情境怎么说。", "end": 684.92}, {"start": 684.92, "text": "The hat或者it was in her hand is was。", "end": 692.45}, {"start": 692.45, "text": "曾经在叫was对吧。", "end": 694.45}, {"start": 694.45, "text": "现在在叫is。", "end": 696.45}, {"start": 696.45, "text": "以前在叫was。", "end": 698.45}, {"start": 698.45, "text": "is的过去式就是was。", "end": 701.45}, {"start": 701.45, "text": "It was in her hands.", "end": 704.45}, {"start": 704.45, "text": "Now,现在。", "end": 707.3}, {"start": 707.3, "text": "It is on the table.", "end": 710.3}, {"start": 710.3, "text": "It was in her hand.", "end": 713.59}, {"start": 713.59, "text": "It is on the table.", "end": 716.59}, {"start": 716.59, "text": "这里就是要区分is跟was。", "end": 719.59}, {"start": 719.59, "text": "存在也分现在存在跟以前存在啊。", "end": 722.59}, {"start": 722.59, "text": "那就得区分这个发音。", "end": 724.59}, {"start": 724.59, "text": "如果本来在她手里你还说is。", "end": 727.59}, {"start": 727.59, "text": "It is in her hand.", "end": 729.59}, {"start": 729.59, "text": "是不是听这句话的人都以为说帽子还在她手里。", "end": 732.59}, {"start": 732.59, "text": "就去找她啦。", "end": 733.59}, {"start": 733.59, "text": "结果找到后发现不在她手里就回来找你啦。", "end": 736.59}, {"start": 736.59, "text": "所以为什么会做一些时态区分对吧。", "end": 740.06}, {"start": 740.06, "text": "这里也是有它的必要性。", "end": 742.06}, {"start": 742.06, "text": "So it was in her hand。", "end": 745.06}, {"start": 745.06, "text": "本来在她手里。", "end": 747.06}, {"start": 747.06, "text": "现在now it is on the table。", "end": 753.06}, {"start": 753.06, "text": "现在在桌上。", "end": 755.06}, {"start": 755.06, "text": "就像汉语我们也要说之前当前这些区分。", "end": 759.06}, {"start": 759.06, "text": "汉语就是直接标时间。", "end": 761.06}, {"start": 762.06, "text": "英语会去动到只是本身。", "end": 764.06}, {"start": 764.06, "text": "各有各的好。", "end": 766.06}, {"start": 766.06, "text": "各有各的特色。", "end": 768.06}, {"start": 768.06, "text": "It was in her hand.", "end": 769.06}, {"start": 769.06, "text": "It is on the table.", "end": 771.65}, {"start": 771.65, "text": "这里我们先打断做一个小练习。", "end": 774.65}, {"start": 774.65, "text": "还是老习惯情境练习。", "end": 777.65}, {"start": 777.65, "text": "只用学过的东西。", "end": 779.65}, {"start": 779.65, "text": "Let's try.", "end": 780.65}, {"start": 780.65, "text": "What happened here?", "end": 781.65}, {"start": 781.65, "text": "发生什么事了?", "end": 782.65}, {"start": 782.65, "text": "What is happening?", "end": 783.65}, {"start": 783.65, "text": "There's a man.", "end": 785.3}, {"start": 785.3, "text": "或者This is a man.", "end": 788.92}, {"start": 788.92, "text": "That is a woman.", "end": 789.92}, {"start": 789.92, "text": "Here is a man.", "end": 790.92}, {"start": 790.92, "text": "There is a woman.", "end": 792.92}, {"start": 792.92, "text": "都可以。", "end": 793.92}, {"start": 793.92, "text": "看我要表达什么。", "end": 794.92}, {"start": 794.92, "text": "帽子不在男人手里了。", "end": 796.92}, {"start": 796.92, "text": "The hat is not in the man's hand.", "end": 798.92}, {"start": 798.92, "text": "It is in the woman's hand.", "end": 801.92}, {"start": 801.92, "text": "这里还有个箭头。", "end": 802.92}, {"start": 802.92, "text": "兔。", "end": 803.92}, {"start": 803.92, "text": "对吧。", "end": 805.51}, {"start": 805.51, "text": "兔就是这个。", "end": 806.51}, {"start": 806.51, "text": "有人不知道兔这个词是什么。", "end": 808.51}, {"start": 808.51, "text": "兔就是这个箭头。", "end": 809.51}, {"start": 809.51, "text": "所以发生了什么?", "end": 810.51}, {"start": 810.51, "text": "这是过去事了。", "end": 811.51}, {"start": 811.51, "text": "He gave。", "end": 814.86}, {"start": 814.86, "text": "不是give。", "end": 815.86}, {"start": 815.86, "text": "也不是giving。", "end": 816.86}, {"start": 816.86, "text": "是gave。", "end": 817.86}, {"start": 817.86, "text": "过去了。", "end": 818.86}, {"start": 818.86, "text": "Gave it。", "end": 821.77}, {"start": 821.77, "text": "或者the hat.", "end": 822.77}, {"start": 822.77, "text": "to the woman。", "end": 827.07}, {"start": 827.07, "text": "或者her。", "end": 829.07}, {"start": 829.07, "text": "注意不是she。", "end": 830.07}, {"start": 830.07, "text": "是her。", "end": 831.07}, {"start": 831.07, "text": "He gave the hat to her.", "end": 833.07}, {"start": 833.07, "text": "没问题吧。", "end": 835.5}, {"start": 835.5, "text": "He gave his hat to her.", "end": 838.5}, {"start": 838.5, "text": "强调是他的帽子。", "end": 840.5}, {"start": 840.5, "text": "那也行。", "end": 841.5}, {"start": 841.5, "text": "His hat to her.", "end": 842.5}, {"start": 842.5, "text": "He gave his hat to her.", "end": 844.5}, {"start": 844.5, "text": "Good。", "end": 845.5}, {"start": 845.5, "text": "你就表达清楚这个词了。", "end": 847.5}, {"start": 847.5, "text": "Let's look at question two.", "end": 850.47}, {"start": 850.47, "text": "这里冒出一个新单词了。", "end": 852.47}, {"start": 852.47, "text": "瓶子。", "end": 853.47}, {"start": 853.47, "text": "bottle.", "end": 854.47}, {"start": 854.47, "text": "b-o-t-t-l-e。", "end": 856.47}, {"start": 856.47, "text": "注意tt要发重音。", "end": 858.47}, {"start": 858.47, "text": "所以是b-o-t-l-e。", "end": 863.16}, {"start": 863.16, "text": "那当然this is a bottle", "end": 866.26}, {"start": 866.26, "text": "还是these are bottles。", "end": 868.26}, {"start": 868.26, "text": "显然这里不止一个瓶子。", "end": 870.26}, {"start": 870.26, "text": "所以什么?", "end": 871.26}, {"start": 871.26, "text": "these are bottles。", "end": 873.26}, {"start": 873.26, "text": "当然我要是站得很远。", "end": 874.26}, {"start": 874.26, "text": "在你们那里。", "end": 875.26}, {"start": 875.26, "text": "你们可以说什么?", "end": 876.26}, {"start": 876.26, "text": "Those are bottles。", "end": 878.26}, {"start": 878.26, "text": "那些是瓶子。", "end": 880.86}, {"start": 880.86, "text": "我站在这里。", "end": 881.86}, {"start": 881.86, "text": "所以我说什么?", "end": 882.86}, {"start": 882.86, "text": "These are bottles。", "end": 884.86}, {"start": 884.86, "text": "拼写。", "end": 885.86}, {"start": 885.86, "text": "我们看一下。", "end": 886.86}, {"start": 886.86, "text": "These are bottles。", "end": 889.86}, {"start": 889.86, "text": "b-o-t-t-l-e。", "end": 891.86}, {"start": 891.86, "text": "好几个s。", "end": 893.58}, {"start": 893.58, "text": "注意are。", "end": 895.2}, {"start": 895.2, "text": "不是is。", "end": 896.2}, {"start": 896.2, "text": "These are bottles。", "end": 898.2}, {"start": 898.2, "text": "都是学过的。", "end": 899.2}, {"start": 899.2, "text": "做个回顾。", "end": 900.2}, {"start": 900.2, "text": "Oh, what is this?", "end": 901.2}, {"start": 901.2, "text": "What is that?", "end": 902.2}, {"start": 902.2, "text": "小船叫boat。", "end": 905.02}, {"start": 905.02, "text": "大船叫ship。", "end": 907.02}, {"start": 907.02, "text": "这就像汉语也会分。", "end": 909.02}, {"start": 909.02, "text": "我们说大小船是现在小孩子说的。", "end": 912.02}, {"start": 912.02, "text": "古代的中国人是不是每一种船", "end": 914.02}, {"start": 914.02, "text": "每一种鱼", "end": 915.02}, {"start": 915.02, "text": "每一种鱼、每一种鸟", "end": 916.02}, {"start": 916.02, "text": "都有不同的字跟发音。", "end": 918.02}, {"start": 918.02, "text": "是不是比英语还复杂?", "end": 920.02}, {"start": 920.02, "text": "所以英语也有一些精确的词被沿用了下来。", "end": 923.02}, {"start": 923.02, "text": "那当然现代英语比古英语简单很多。", "end": 926.02}, {"start": 926.02, "text": "百化文统理。", "end": 927.02}, {"start": 927.02, "text": "现代汉语比古汉语简化了很多。", "end": 930.02}, {"start": 930.02, "text": "所以我们当然可以说大船。", "end": 932.02}, {"start": 932.02, "text": "A big boat。", "end": 933.02}, {"start": 933.02, "text": "可以这么说。", "end": 934.02}, {"start": 934.02, "text": "当然big boat说成一个词是什么?", "end": 936.51}, {"start": 936.51, "text": "ship。", "end": 937.51}, {"start": 937.51, "text": "就是中文的舰。", "end": 939.51}, {"start": 939.51, "text": "站舰的舰。", "end": 940.51}, {"start": 940.51, "text": "船跟舰差在哪里?", "end": 941.51}, {"start": 941.51, "text": "大小。", "end": 942.51}, {"start": 942.51, "text": "So this。", "end": 945.26}, {"start": 945.26, "text": "当然它很远。", "end": 946.26}, {"start": 946.26, "text": "我不能站在海上说。", "end": 947.26}, {"start": 947.26, "text": "所以that is a ship。", "end": 951.26}, {"start": 951.26, "text": "It。", "end": 953.27}, {"start": 953.27, "text": "它是一个物体。", "end": 954.27}, {"start": 954.27, "text": "It is on the water。", "end": 958.27}, {"start": 958.27, "text": "它在水里吗?", "end": 959.27}, {"start": 959.27, "text": "In the water。", "end": 960.27}, {"start": 960.27, "text": "有一种ship可以进到水里。", "end": 962.27}, {"start": 962.27, "text": "就是什么?", "end": 963.27}, {"start": 963.27, "text": "Summering。", "end": 964.27}, {"start": 964.27, "text": "当然这里显然不是。", "end": 965.27}, {"start": 965.27, "text": "这像一个货船。", "end": 966.27}, {"start": 966.27, "text": "It is on the water。", "end": 968.27}, {"start": 968.27, "text": "拼写。", "end": 969.27}, {"start": 969.27, "text": "The ship is on the water。", "end": 973.27}, {"start": 973.27, "text": "没问题。", "end": 974.27}, {"start": 974.27, "text": "The ship is on the water。", "end": 975.27}, {"start": 975.27, "text": "最后一个。", "end": 976.27}, {"start": 976.27, "text": "这个女人要戴上自己的帽子了。", "end": 978.27}, {"start": 978.27, "text": "我们可以说the woman。", "end": 980.27}, {"start": 980.27, "text": "我们也可以说这个女人。", "end": 981.27}, {"start": 981.27, "text": "This woman。", "end": 982.27}, {"start": 982.27, "text": "对吧。", "end": 983.27}, {"start": 983.27, "text": "泛泛而止就是the。", "end": 985.27}, {"start": 985.27, "text": "如果这里就是this woman。", "end": 987.7}, {"start": 987.7, "text": "如果是那里就是that woman。", "end": 989.7}, {"start": 989.7, "text": "如果好几个在这里就是these women。", "end": 991.7}, {"start": 991.7, "text": "如果那里有好几个就是those women。", "end": 994.7}, {"start": 994.7, "text": "是不是都是刚学的。", "end": 995.7}, {"start": 995.7, "text": "好。", "end": 996.7}, {"start": 996.7, "text": "我们简化一点。", "end": 997.7}, {"start": 997.7, "text": "She。", "end": 998.7}, {"start": 998.7, "text": "可以吧。", "end": 999.7}, {"start": 999.7, "text": "She正在戴。", "end": 1002.3}, {"start": 1002.3, "text": "Right?", "end": 1003.3}, {"start": 1003.3, "text": "She is putting the hat。", "end": 1006.3}, {"start": 1006.3, "text": "Putting。", "end": 1008.4}, {"start": 1008.4, "text": "正在put。", "end": 1009.4}, {"start": 1009.4, "text": "Right?", "end": 1010.4}, {"start": 1010.4, "text": "Put.", "end": 1011.4}, {"start": 1011.4, "text": "Take.", "end": 1012.4}, {"start": 1012.4, "text": "Give.", "end": 1014.49}, {"start": 1014.49, "text": "She is putting her hat on her head。", "end": 1019.49}, {"start": 1019.49, "text": "当然你也可以说putting it on her head。", "end": 1023.3}, {"start": 1023.3, "text": "你不用强调是她的帽子。", "end": 1025.3}, {"start": 1025.3, "text": "对吧。", "end": 1027.05}, {"start": 1027.05, "text": "真正讲起来一般都是从简。", "end": 1029.05}, {"start": 1029.05, "text": "当然你这个看个人习惯吧。", "end": 1031.05}, {"start": 1031.05, "text": "She is putting her hat on。", "end": 1034.86}, {"start": 1034.86, "text": "她索性把后面都省略了。", "end": 1036.86}, {"start": 1036.86, "text": "就说什么。", "end": 1037.86}, {"start": 1037.86, "text": "She is putting her hat on。", "end": 1040.86}, {"start": 1040.86, "text": "她连head都不说了。", "end": 1042.86}, {"start": 1042.86, "text": "这就是一个从简。", "end": 1044.86}, {"start": 1044.86, "text": "因为戴帽子肯定是放头上。", "end": 1046.86}, {"start": 1046.86, "text": "不会on her hand。", "end": 1048.86}, {"start": 1048.86, "text": "疯了。", "end": 1049.86}, {"start": 1049.86, "text": "Right?", "end": 1050.86}, {"start": 1050.86, "text": "这种常识性有时候会被省略掉。", "end": 1052.86}, {"start": 1052.86, "text": "这是正常的。", "end": 1053.86}, {"start": 1053.86, "text": "并不是一个语法问题。", "end": 1054.86}, {"start": 1054.86, "text": "这是一个表意的问题。", "end": 1056.86}, {"start": 1056.86, "text": "She is putting her hat on。", "end": 1059.86}, {"start": 1059.86, "text": "Good。", "end": 1061.71}, {"start": 1061.71, "text": "这次练习并不难。", "end": 1063.71}, {"start": 1063.71, "text": "刚刚的练习并不难。", "end": 1064.71}, {"start": 1064.71, "text": "我们稍微进阶一下。", "end": 1066.71}, {"start": 1066.71, "text": "把第五、第六节课的东西再运用第三次。", "end": 1070.71}, {"start": 1070.71, "text": "Right?", "end": 1071.71}, {"start": 1071.71, "text": "到了第三次你已经很有感觉了。", "end": 1073.71}, {"start": 1073.71, "text": "到五次你就已经准母语了。", "end": 1075.71}, {"start": 1075.71, "text": "So let's see。", "end": 1078.78}, {"start": 1078.78, "text": "这个帽子看起来还没完全落地。", "end": 1080.78}, {"start": 1080.78, "text": "所以按照原则上这是正在进行时。", "end": 1083.78}, {"start": 1083.78, "text": "Right?", "end": 1084.78}, {"start": 1084.78, "text": "He is putting it或者the hat。", "end": 1090.76}, {"start": 1090.76, "text": "或者他的帽子。", "end": 1091.76}, {"start": 1091.76, "text": "His hat on the table。", "end": 1094.51}, {"start": 1094.51, "text": "没问题吧。", "end": 1095.51}, {"start": 1095.51, "text": "He is putting his hat on the table。", "end": 1098.17}, {"start": 1098.17, "text": "我们看一下拼写。", "end": 1099.17}, {"start": 1099.17, "text": "He is putting the hat on the table。", "end": 1103.17}, {"start": 1103.17, "text": "Is putting。", "end": 1104.17}, {"start": 1104.17, "text": "他在做这个事。", "end": 1107.59}, {"start": 1107.59, "text": "这是is,不是are。", "end": 1109.59}, {"start": 1109.59, "text": "这也是一个男人,所以是is。", "end": 1111.59}, {"start": 1111.59, "text": "他还没开始放bottle。", "end": 1113.59}, {"start": 1113.59, "text": "记得吧。", "end": 1114.59}, {"start": 1114.59, "text": "That's a bottle,不是hat啦。", "end": 1116.59}, {"start": 1116.59, "text": "He will put。", "end": 1120.91}, {"start": 1120.91, "text": "He will put the bottle on the table。", "end": 1125.95}, {"start": 1125.95, "text": "看一下拼写。", "end": 1126.95}, {"start": 1126.95, "text": "回顾一下bottle的拼写。", "end": 1128.95}, {"start": 1128.95, "text": "He will put the bottle on the table。", "end": 1132.95}, {"start": 1132.95, "text": "很多你们都会啦。", "end": 1133.95}, {"start": 1133.95, "text": "Right?", "end": 1134.95}, {"start": 1134.95, "text": "用一用就有感觉啦。", "end": 1135.95}, {"start": 1135.95, "text": "这里设计两个人。", "end": 1137.95}, {"start": 1137.95, "text": "They are both men。", "end": 1138.95}, {"start": 1138.95, "text": "他们都是男人。", "end": 1139.95}, {"start": 1139.95, "text": "Right?", "end": 1140.95}, {"start": 1140.95, "text": "This is a man, that is a man。", "end": 1142.95}, {"start": 1142.95, "text": "These are men。", "end": 1143.95}, {"start": 1143.95, "text": "当然我也可以说they are men。", "end": 1145.95}, {"start": 1145.95, "text": "很多人忘了they这个词。", "end": 1147.95}, {"start": 1147.95, "text": "第一节课的。", "end": 1148.95}, {"start": 1148.95, "text": "They,他们。", "end": 1149.95}, {"start": 1149.95, "text": "Right?", "end": 1150.95}, {"start": 1150.95, "text": "我不说这里也不说那里。", "end": 1151.95}, {"start": 1151.95, "text": "我不强调这个。", "end": 1152.95}, {"start": 1152.95, "text": "我只说这群物体。", "end": 1156.42}, {"start": 1156.42, "text": "They are men。", "end": 1158.42}, {"start": 1158.42, "text": "他们是男人。", "end": 1159.42}, {"start": 1159.42, "text": "He will give。", "end": 1164.53}, {"start": 1164.53, "text": "Give。", "end": 1165.53}, {"start": 1165.53, "text": "Give it。", "end": 1167.66}, {"start": 1167.66, "text": "或者the bottle to him。", "end": 1172.39}, {"start": 1172.39, "text": "记得吧。", "end": 1174.37}, {"start": 1174.37, "text": "He will give the bottle to him。", "end": 1178.12}, {"start": 1178.12, "text": "拼写。", "end": 1179.12}, {"start": 1179.12, "text": "He will give the bottle to him。", "end": 1183.78}, {"start": 1183.78, "text": "是不是很严谨的一句话。", "end": 1184.78}, {"start": 1184.78, "text": "主语he。", "end": 1187.53}, {"start": 1187.53, "text": "宾语him。", "end": 1188.53}, {"start": 1188.53, "text": "To 方向。", "end": 1190.53}, {"start": 1190.53, "text": "物体the bottle 动作give。", "end": 1194.47}, {"start": 1194.47, "text": "He will give the bottle to him。", "end": 1196.47}, {"start": 1196.47, "text": "所以你们看。", "end": 1197.47}, {"start": 1197.47, "text": "直接学会运用语言。", "end": 1199.47}, {"start": 1200.47, "text": "是强于直接背语法。", "end": 1201.47}, {"start": 1201.47, "text": "你去背这个语法你累。", "end": 1203.47}, {"start": 1203.47, "text": "你也不理解。", "end": 1204.47}, {"start": 1204.47, "text": "但是你长期这么去用。", "end": 1206.47}, {"start": 1206.47, "text": "再去回顾语法的时候。", "end": 1208.47}, {"start": 1208.47, "text": "你又会觉得语法那么理所当然。", "end": 1211.47}, {"start": 1211.47, "text": "所以我一直说语法是事后总结的。", "end": 1213.47}, {"start": 1213.47, "text": "不是事前学习用的。", "end": 1215.47}, {"start": 1215.47, "text": "Remember that。", "end": 1216.47}, {"start": 1216.47, "text": "记住我们的学习法则。", "end": 1218.47}, {"start": 1218.47, "text": "没听思维课的。", "end": 1219.47}, {"start": 1219.47, "text": "赶紧回去听。", "end": 1220.47}, {"start": 1220.47, "text": "他正在拿起。", "end": 1221.47}, {"start": 1221.47, "text": "我看这个瓶子的底已经离开桌面了。", "end": 1224.47}, {"start": 1224.47, "text": "这个画师非常用心。", "end": 1226.47}, {"start": 1226.47, "text": "所以应该是taking。", "end": 1228.47}, {"start": 1228.47, "text": "已经是taking了。", "end": 1229.47}, {"start": 1229.47, "text": "不是will take了。", "end": 1231.47}, {"start": 1231.47, "text": "当然人者见人。", "end": 1232.47}, {"start": 1232.47, "text": "我也不确定。", "end": 1233.47}, {"start": 1242.1, "text": "记得吧。", "end": 1243.1}, {"start": 1243.1, "text": "开关灯。", "end": 1244.1}, {"start": 1244.1, "text": "Turn on the light.", "end": 1245.1}, {"start": 1245.1, "text": "Turn off the light.", "end": 1246.1}, {"start": 1246.1, "text": "拿起来。", "end": 1247.1}, {"start": 1247.1, "text": "Take off.", "end": 1248.1}, {"start": 1248.1, "text": "放回去。", "end": 1249.1}, {"start": 1249.1, "text": "Put on.", "end": 1250.1}, {"start": 1259.1, "text": "一个O发O。", "end": 1260.1}, {"start": 1260.1, "text": "两个O发U。", "end": 1262.1}, {"start": 1262.1, "text": "其实也不是。", "end": 1263.1}, {"start": 1263.1, "text": "一个O发O。", "end": 1264.1}, {"start": 1264.1, "text": "两个O发O。", "end": 1267.1}, {"start": 1267.1, "text": "所以你看英国人原本的很多OO的发音。", "end": 1270.1}, {"start": 1270.1, "text": "都是什么?", "end": 1271.1}, {"start": 1271.1, "text": "譬如说我儿子的名字MOOCHI。", "end": 1276.1}, {"start": 1276.1, "text": "我讲MOOCHI。", "end": 1278.1}, {"start": 1278.1, "text": "但其实如果是古英国人。", "end": 1280.1}, {"start": 1280.1, "text": "他可能会遵循O的声音。", "end": 1282.1}, {"start": 1282.1, "text": "那就是什么?", "end": 1283.1}, {"start": 1283.1, "text": "MOOCHI。", "end": 1285.1}, {"start": 1285.1, "text": "他会这样讲。", "end": 1286.1}, {"start": 1286.1, "text": "有没有?", "end": 1287.1}, {"start": 1287.1, "text": "音腔就是有点发原始音。", "end": 1289.1}, {"start": 1289.1, "text": "MOOCHI。", "end": 1291.1}, {"start": 1291.1, "text": "现在美国人会说什么?", "end": 1292.1}, {"start": 1292.1, "text": "MOOCHI。", "end": 1293.1}, {"start": 1293.1, "text": "会比较懒惰一点。", "end": 1294.1}, {"start": 1294.1, "text": "不会R的音全部发出来。", "end": 1296.1}, {"start": 1296.1, "text": "所以这个口音。", "end": 1297.1}, {"start": 1297.1, "text": "他是有历史原因的。", "end": 1299.1}, {"start": 1299.1, "text": "不要去模仿。", "end": 1301.1}, {"start": 1301.1, "text": "你能把音腔发出来off。", "end": 1303.1}, {"start": 1303.1, "text": "OO。", "end": 1304.69}, {"start": 1304.69, "text": "OR。", "end": 1305.69}, {"start": 1305.69, "text": "也行。", "end": 1306.69}, {"start": 1306.69, "text": "也算对的。", "end": 1307.69}, {"start": 1307.69, "text": "去注重发音就好了。", "end": 1309.69}, {"start": 1309.69, "text": "She is taking it off the table.", "end": 1311.69}, {"start": 1311.69, "text": "taking。", "end": 1312.69}, {"start": 1312.69, "text": "正在拿。", "end": 1313.69}, {"start": 1313.69, "text": "taking it off。", "end": 1314.69}, {"start": 1314.69, "text": "所以我刚刚的推测是对的。", "end": 1316.69}, {"start": 1316.69, "text": "这个属于是正在做。", "end": 1317.69}, {"start": 1317.69, "text": "taking。", "end": 1318.69}, {"start": 1318.69, "text": "She is taking it off the table.", "end": 1321.31}, {"start": 1321.31, "text": "截止到这里。", "end": 1322.31}, {"start": 1322.31, "text": "我们这次小小的情境回顾。", "end": 1324.31}, {"start": 1324.31, "text": "走了一遍。", "end": 1325.31}, {"start": 1325.31, "text": "是不是感觉比之前强?", "end": 1327.31}, {"start": 1327.31, "text": "各位注意。", "end": 1328.31}, {"start": 1328.31, "text": "语感值千斤。", "end": 1329.31}, {"start": 1329.31, "text": "你去积累几次。", "end": 1331.31}, {"start": 1331.31, "text": "你大脑会越来越深化理解。", "end": 1333.31}, {"start": 1333.31, "text": "会越来越加强那个神经回路。", "end": 1336.31}, {"start": 1336.31, "text": "到第五次左右。", "end": 1337.31}, {"start": 1337.31, "text": "那个纤维。", "end": 1338.31}, {"start": 1338.31, "text": "就是那个随窍。", "end": 1340.31}, {"start": 1340.31, "text": "会比之前发达很多。", "end": 1342.31}, {"start": 1342.31, "text": "你就会开始有母语者的感觉了。", "end": 1345.31}, {"start": 1345.31, "text": "这比背丹词背语法硬核多啦。", "end": 1348.31}, {"start": 1348.31, "text": "所以记住遵循这个原则坚持下去。", "end": 1351.31}, {"start": 1351.31, "text": "我们今天是第六节。", "end": 1352.31}, {"start": 1352.31, "text": "Lesson 6。", "end": 1353.31}, {"start": 1353.31, "text": "那第六节的这个实战部分。", "end": 1356.31}, {"start": 1356.31, "text": "根据所给的图片。", "end": 1358.31}, {"start": 1358.31, "text": "描述以下图片的过程。", "end": 1360.31}, {"start": 1360.31, "text": "This is fun,好玩。", "end": 1361.31}, {"start": 1361.31, "text": "Let's see what happens。", "end": 1363.81}, {"start": 1363.81, "text": "显然这是各位女士最爱看的一个情节。", "end": 1368.81}, {"start": 1368.81, "text": "这个帅哥。", "end": 1370.81}, {"start": 1370.81, "text": "皮肤白。", "end": 1371.81}, {"start": 1371.81, "text": "大长腿。", "end": 1372.81}, {"start": 1372.81, "text": "1米85。", "end": 1373.81}, {"start": 1373.81, "text": "他拿着一束鲜花。", "end": 1375.81}, {"start": 1375.81, "text": "Some flowers.", "end": 1378.43}, {"start": 1378.43, "text": "They are on the table.", "end": 1379.43}, {"start": 1379.43, "text": "他想啥。", "end": 1381.43}, {"start": 1381.43, "text": "虚线小语音就是想。", "end": 1383.43}, {"start": 1383.43, "text": "Thinking, right?", "end": 1384.43}, {"start": 1384.43, "text": "他想给他最爱的妹子。", "end": 1386.43}, {"start": 1386.43, "text": "这一看就是单位的同事。", "end": 1388.43}, {"start": 1388.43, "text": "标准单位同事长相。", "end": 1390.43}, {"start": 1390.43, "text": "素颜。", "end": 1392.43}, {"start": 1392.43, "text": "这个头发盖下来。", "end": 1394.43}, {"start": 1394.43, "text": "穿一个很素雅、典雅的。", "end": 1396.43}, {"start": 1396.43, "text": "但是比较朴素的一个配色的裙子。", "end": 1399.43}, {"start": 1399.43, "text": "这也是我们火柴人系列第一次长得这么具体的妹子。", "end": 1404.38}, {"start": 1404.38, "text": "来,让我们感受一下。", "end": 1406.38}, {"start": 1406.38, "text": "这个怎么去描述?", "end": 1408.38}, {"start": 1408.38, "text": "肯定从这里开始说嘛。", "end": 1410.38}, {"start": 1410.38, "text": "对啊,你不会从想象开始说。", "end": 1412.38}, {"start": 1412.38, "text": "你这样别人听的云里雾里的。", "end": 1414.38}, {"start": 1414.38, "text": "云里雾里,还真的就是云里雾里。", "end": 1416.38}, {"start": 1416.38, "text": "This man。", "end": 1418.38}, {"start": 1418.38, "text": "我们可以这么说吧。", "end": 1420.38}, {"start": 1420.38, "text": "或者He flowers。", "end": 1425.67}, {"start": 1425.67, "text": "他要怎么做?", "end": 1428.78}, {"start": 1428.78, "text": "He will。", "end": 1431.24}, {"start": 1431.24, "text": "我们是不是可以这样说?", "end": 1433.24}, {"start": 1433.24, "text": "他打算。", "end": 1434.24}, {"start": 1434.24, "text": "我们用我们所学。", "end": 1436.24}, {"start": 1436.24, "text": "He will give her flowers.", "end": 1449.14}, {"start": 1449.14, "text": "He will give her flowers.", "end": 1451.14}, {"start": 1451.14, "text": "The flowers。", "end": 1453.14}, {"start": 1453.14, "text": "这些花。", "end": 1455.5}, {"start": 1455.5, "text": "Are on the table.", "end": 1458.28}, {"start": 1458.28, "text": "正在桌上。", "end": 1459.28}, {"start": 1459.28, "text": "Are on the table.", "end": 1461.28}, {"start": 1461.28, "text": "不是was或者were。", "end": 1463.74}, {"start": 1463.74, "text": "不是以前啦。", "end": 1464.74}, {"start": 1464.74, "text": "这是现在。", "end": 1466.74}, {"start": 1466.74, "text": "The flowers are on the table.", "end": 1468.74}, {"start": 1468.74, "text": "He will give the flowers to her.", "end": 1474.25}, {"start": 1474.25, "text": "He loves her.", "end": 1478.03}, {"start": 1478.03, "text": "他爱她。", "end": 1479.03}, {"start": 1479.03, "text": "Or he likes her.", "end": 1480.03}, {"start": 1480.03, "text": "我们不要讲得那么严重。", "end": 1481.03}, {"start": 1481.03, "text": "可能就是一个不展开。", "end": 1483.03}, {"start": 1483.03, "text": "He likes her.", "end": 1485.03}, {"start": 1485.03, "text": "他喜欢她。", "end": 1486.03}, {"start": 1486.03, "text": "我们这样讲就好。", "end": 1487.03}, {"start": 1487.03, "text": "He likes her.", "end": 1488.03}, {"start": 1488.03, "text": "He will give the flowers to her.", "end": 1490.03}, {"start": 1490.03, "text": "She。", "end": 1491.03}, {"start": 1491.03, "text": "我们换一个主语说。", "end": 1493.03}, {"start": 1493.03, "text": "She will take the flowers from him.", "end": 1496.03}, {"start": 1496.03, "text": "To from.", "end": 1499.6}, {"start": 1499.6, "text": "Teacher Eric,顺便让你们接触from这个介词。", "end": 1502.6}, {"start": 1502.6, "text": "箭头朝着对象。", "end": 1504.6}, {"start": 1504.6, "text": "那就是to。", "end": 1506.6}, {"start": 1506.6, "text": "你就是箭头的朝向。", "end": 1508.6}, {"start": 1508.6, "text": "From。", "end": 1510.06}, {"start": 1510.06, "text": "所以这两个介词我们顺便了解一下。", "end": 1513.06}, {"start": 1513.06, "text": "那好了。", "end": 1514.06}, {"start": 1514.06, "text": "回到案例里。", "end": 1515.06}, {"start": 1515.06, "text": "基本上的截止这里也就阐述完了。", "end": 1517.06}, {"start": 1517.06, "text": "那好了。", "end": 1518.06}, {"start": 1518.06, "text": "有人就会说。", "end": 1519.06}, {"start": 1519.06, "text": "如果我要去书写呢。", "end": 1521.06}, {"start": 1521.06, "text": "如果我要说的这个事情。", "end": 1523.06}, {"start": 1523.06, "text": "更宏大规范一点。", "end": 1525.06}, {"start": 1525.06, "text": "我们又把标准提高到。", "end": 1527.06}, {"start": 1527.06, "text": "略微超出我们已学的这些。", "end": 1529.06}, {"start": 1529.06, "text": "给一些做雅思的也好。", "end": 1531.06}, {"start": 1531.06, "text": "写作的也好的学生看一下。", "end": 1533.06}, {"start": 1533.06, "text": "那已经学的人。", "end": 1534.06}, {"start": 1534.06, "text": "你看你能看懂多少。", "end": 1536.06}, {"start": 1536.06, "text": "努力理解的过程。", "end": 1537.06}, {"start": 1537.06, "text": "就是一次循环。", "end": 1538.06}, {"start": 1538.06, "text": "记得这个概念吧。", "end": 1540.06}, {"start": 1540.06, "text": "我们也看一下拼写。", "end": 1541.06}, {"start": 1541.06, "text": "A man is taking a bunch of flowers from the table.", "end": 1547.06}, {"start": 1547.06, "text": "A man。", "end": 1549.39}, {"start": 1549.39, "text": "为什么是a man?", "end": 1550.39}, {"start": 1550.39, "text": "这里说一个男人。", "end": 1552.39}, {"start": 1552.39, "text": "如果我说the man。", "end": 1554.39}, {"start": 1554.39, "text": "注意一下贯词。", "end": 1555.39}, {"start": 1555.39, "text": "如果是the man。", "end": 1556.39}, {"start": 1556.39, "text": "那说明什么?", "end": 1557.39}, {"start": 1557.39, "text": "是这个男人。", "end": 1559.89}, {"start": 1559.89, "text": "特指这个男人。", "end": 1560.89}, {"start": 1560.89, "text": "如果是a man。", "end": 1561.89}, {"start": 1561.89, "text": "就是贩子一个男人。", "end": 1563.89}, {"start": 1563.89, "text": "这里说a man。", "end": 1564.89}, {"start": 1564.89, "text": "就是贩子的。", "end": 1565.89}, {"start": 1565.89, "text": "所以他这里没有很具体。", "end": 1566.89}, {"start": 1566.89, "text": "当然如果是Eric写的话。", "end": 1568.89}, {"start": 1568.89, "text": "我会写the man。", "end": 1569.89}, {"start": 1569.89, "text": "因为这里有图。", "end": 1571.89}, {"start": 1571.89, "text": "A man或者the man is taking", "end": 1575.7}, {"start": 1575.7, "text": "a bunch of。", "end": 1576.7}, {"start": 1576.7, "text": "就不用看了。", "end": 1577.7}, {"start": 1577.7, "text": "taking flowers from the table。", "end": 1581.23}, {"start": 1581.23, "text": "是不是都是学过的。", "end": 1582.23}, {"start": 1582.23, "text": "A man is taking flowers from the table.", "end": 1585.23}, {"start": 1585.23, "text": "is taking。", "end": 1586.82}, {"start": 1586.82, "text": "说明他正在做这件事。", "end": 1588.82}, {"start": 1588.82, "text": "Right?", "end": 1589.82}, {"start": 1589.82, "text": "He is taking the flowers from the table.", "end": 1591.82}, {"start": 1591.82, "text": "同时他在遐想。", "end": 1593.82}, {"start": 1593.82, "text": "What is he thinking?", "end": 1594.82}, {"start": 1594.82, "text": "What is he thinking?", "end": 1595.82}, {"start": 1595.82, "text": "He is thinking。", "end": 1596.82}, {"start": 1596.82, "text": "正在思考。", "end": 1597.82}, {"start": 1597.82, "text": "He is thinking。", "end": 1599.82}, {"start": 1599.82, "text": "He。", "end": 1601.29}, {"start": 1601.29, "text": "男生的他。", "end": 1602.29}, {"start": 1602.29, "text": "He is thinking that", "end": 1604.29}, {"start": 1604.29, "text": "他要干嘛?", "end": 1605.29}, {"start": 1605.29, "text": "他在想什么?", "end": 1606.29}, {"start": 1606.29, "text": "He will give the flowers to a woman.", "end": 1612.29}, {"start": 1612.29, "text": "the man。", "end": 1614.36}, {"start": 1614.36, "text": "就当是我好了。", "end": 1615.36}, {"start": 1615.36, "text": "He will give.", "end": 1618.36}, {"start": 1618.36, "text": "give, put, take。", "end": 1623.17}, {"start": 1623.17, "text": "记得吧。", "end": 1624.17}, {"start": 1624.17, "text": "give, I give you。", "end": 1626.86}, {"start": 1626.86, "text": "注意这个动词。", "end": 1627.86}, {"start": 1627.86, "text": "He will give the flowers to a woman.", "end": 1634.86}, {"start": 1634.86, "text": "当然这里a woman也可以说成什么?", "end": 1637.86}, {"start": 1637.86, "text": "her, to her。", "end": 1639.86}, {"start": 1639.86, "text": "也可以。", "end": 1640.86}, {"start": 1640.86, "text": "注意这里的will give。", "end": 1641.86}, {"start": 1641.86, "text": "这个未来时态。", "end": 1643.86}, {"start": 1643.86, "text": "Will give。", "end": 1644.86}, {"start": 1644.86, "text": "讲的是未来时。", "end": 1646.86}, {"start": 1646.86, "text": "She will be very happy.", "end": 1651.7}, {"start": 1651.7, "text": "She is the woman.", "end": 1653.7}, {"start": 1653.7, "text": "你也可以说the woman will be very happy.", "end": 1656.7}, {"start": 1656.7, "text": "She will be very happy。", "end": 1658.7}, {"start": 1658.7, "text": "都是学过的。", "end": 1659.7}, {"start": 1659.7, "text": "有人就说teacher Eric。", "end": 1661.7}, {"start": 1661.7, "text": "为什么是?", "end": 1662.7}, {"start": 1662.7, "text": "不是。", "end": 1663.7}, {"start": 1663.7, "text": "She will is very happy。", "end": 1665.7}, {"start": 1665.7, "text": "经常有中学生写", "end": 1666.7}, {"start": 1666.7, "text": "She will is, she will as.", "end": 1668.7}, {"start": 1668.7, "text": "is和was的原态就是be。", "end": 1672.33}, {"start": 1672.33, "text": "英语的be是什么意思呢?", "end": 1674.82}, {"start": 1674.82, "text": "就是中文的存在。", "end": 1677.77}, {"start": 1677.77, "text": "I am a being。", "end": 1679.77}, {"start": 1679.77, "text": "我是一个存在者的东西。", "end": 1680.77}, {"start": 1680.77, "text": "Being就是什么?", "end": 1682.77}, {"start": 1682.77, "text": "生物或者活生生的东西。", "end": 1684.77}, {"start": 1684.77, "text": "So will be。", "end": 1686.77}, {"start": 1686.77, "text": "未来会be。", "end": 1688.77}, {"start": 1688.77, "text": "区别于什么?", "end": 1690.33}, {"start": 1690.33, "text": "现在的be is和过去的be was。", "end": 1695.33}, {"start": 1695.33, "text": "I was a child。", "end": 1699.14}, {"start": 1699.14, "text": "我曾经是孩子。", "end": 1700.14}, {"start": 1700.14, "text": "I was a child。", "end": 1701.14}, {"start": 1701.14, "text": "刚学的词。", "end": 1702.14}, {"start": 1702.14, "text": "He is a man。", "end": 1706.62}, {"start": 1706.62, "text": "他此刻正是个男人。", "end": 1708.62}, {"start": 1708.62, "text": "He was a boy。", "end": 1710.62}, {"start": 1710.62, "text": "他曾经是个男孩。", "end": 1713.86}, {"start": 1713.86, "text": "He will be a grandpa。", "end": 1715.86}, {"start": 1715.86, "text": "他即将成为一个爷爷。", "end": 1719.86}, {"start": 1719.86, "text": "所以be是原生态。", "end": 1722.29}, {"start": 1722.29, "text": "现在时是is。", "end": 1724.29}, {"start": 1724.29, "text": "过去时是was。", "end": 1725.29}, {"start": 1725.29, "text": "未来就是原态。", "end": 1727.29}, {"start": 1727.29, "text": "Will be。", "end": 1728.29}, {"start": 1728.29, "text": "Will be very happy。", "end": 1730.29}, {"start": 1730.29, "text": "今天又引入了一个新概念", "end": 1732.29}, {"start": 1732.29, "text": "就是is be和was的关系。", "end": 1734.29}, {"start": 1734.29, "text": "其实是同一个词就是be。", "end": 1736.29}, {"start": 1736.29, "text": "它在不同的时态下", "end": 1738.29}, {"start": 1738.29, "text": "会有不同的这个。", "end": 1739.29}, {"start": 1739.29, "text": "它还有一个时代是am。", "end": 1741.29}, {"start": 1741.29, "text": "I am也是be。", "end": 1742.29}, {"start": 1742.29, "text": "基本上你能理解这一段了。", "end": 1744.29}, {"start": 1744.29, "text": "你们几个邻居的都能理解了。", "end": 1746.29}, {"start": 1746.29, "text": "那书写跟阅读来说", "end": 1749.29}, {"start": 1749.29, "text": "包括雅诗。", "end": 1750.29}, {"start": 1750.29, "text": "你能做到这个基础的表述能力", "end": 1752.29}, {"start": 1752.29, "text": "能清楚的表达这些东西。", "end": 1754.29}, {"start": 1754.29, "text": "说明你的基础功已经不错了。", "end": 1756.29}, {"start": 1756.29, "text": "你能去表达更复杂的意识了。", "end": 1758.29}, {"start": 1758.29, "text": "也在此注意一下书写。", "end": 1761.29}, {"start": 1761.29, "text": "The man is taking flowers from the table.", "end": 1765.29}, {"start": 1765.29, "text": "He is thinking that he will give the flowers to a woman.", "end": 1768.29}, {"start": 1768.29, "text": "She will be very happy。", "end": 1770.29}, {"start": 1770.29, "text": "如果女的现在就很高兴。", "end": 1773.3}, {"start": 1773.3, "text": "那就是she is very happy。", "end": 1775.3}, {"start": 1775.3, "text": "如果女的以前很高兴。", "end": 1777.3}, {"start": 1777.3, "text": "She was very happy。", "end": 1778.3}, {"start": 1779.3, "text": "如果女的未来可能会很高兴。", "end": 1781.3}, {"start": 1781.3, "text": "那就是is的原态。", "end": 1783.3}, {"start": 1783.3, "text": "She will be very happy。", "end": 1785.3}, {"start": 1785.3, "text": "也帮大家最后总结一下这个。", "end": 1787.3}, {"start": 1787.3, "text": "That was lesson 6。", "end": 1789.3}, {"start": 1789.3, "text": "这就是第6节。", "end": 1790.3}, {"start": 1790.3, "text": "最后给大家一个小小的好玩的情景去感知一下。", "end": 1793.3}, {"start": 1793.3, "text": "也看一下自己的拼写。", "end": 1795.3}, {"start": 1795.3, "text": "Lesson 7 will be built on lesson 1 to 6.", "end": 1799.3}, {"start": 1799.3, "text": "We will further our process of English learning.", "end": 1802.3}, {"start": 1802.3, "text": "第7节会延续1到6节讲的这些。", "end": 1805.3}, {"start": 1805.3, "text": "会有回顾。", "end": 1806.3}, {"start": 1806.3, "text": "会有新鲜的部分。", "end": 1808.3}, {"start": 1808.3, "text": "I will see you in our next lesson。", "end": 1810.3}, {"start": 1810.3, "text": "我将在第7节再和大家会合。", "end": 1814.3}]}